abstract: >-
  All ten advertised OpenAI advances are rejected under the SFT reality
  test. Twelve exact source-artifact validity propositions are disproved,
  twelve materially distinct SFT replacements are proved, no validity
  transfers to the imported artifacts, and no proof chains remain open.
